@FootballGm.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000
@accessToken = replace-with-token-from-register-or-login

### Health check (anonymous)
GET {{FootballGm.Api_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### OpenAPI document
GET {{FootballGm.Api_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json

### Register a user (returns JWT)
POST {{FootballGm.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "gm@example.com",
  "password": "correct-horse-battery",
  "displayName": "Nick"
}

### Login (returns JWT)
POST {{FootballGm.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "gm@example.com",
  "password": "correct-horse-battery"
}

### Current user from database (requires Authorization header)
GET {{FootballGm.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Mint a JWT (Development only — no user account lookup)
POST {{FootballGm.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tokens
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "subject": "dev-user-1",
  "displayName": "Dev GM"
}

### Verify bearer token claims (requires Authorization header)
GET {{FootballGm.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tokens/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json
